    <description>Recalculate ARR for products when relevant fields change on the Account
BOPI-628 Updated to fix a bug where changes on the account Annual Print Statement Volume wasn&apos;t triggering the product updates properly
BOPI-727 Updated to remove Annual Print Statement volume from HC recalculation, this field is now on the Opportunity
BOPI-798 Edu DOM no longer depends on the shipping country. Removed the recalculation when the shipping country changes</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>AccountChangeNow</name>
        <dataType>String</dataType>
        <expression>&quot;Acc Change &quot; +TEXT(NOW())</expression>
